[
    {
        "content": "<p>Consider the following example, representing types with a (meaningless) type substitution:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bool\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"int\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bool\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"int\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>TyDenote (Tag.toTy .b)</code> should be definitionally equal to <code>Bool</code>, but <code>rfl</code> fails:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mismatch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n<span class=\"n\">has</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">3</span>\n<span class=\"n\">but</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>However, if I unfold definitions and then use <code>rfl</code>, it succeeds:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">unfold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denote</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This seems bizarre to me, since clearly the terms are definitionally equal. I must be misunderstanding something about <code>rfl</code>; I was under the impression it shows definitional equality whenever the two terms can be reduced fully to the same expression.</p>\n<p>The reason I ask is that I would like to define a function like the following:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">denoteTag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>But Lean cannot show the definitional equality and so it forces me to write an explicit equality proof and cast.  How can I convince Lean that this equality holds definitionally?</p>",
        "id": 580460011,
        "sender_full_name": "Josh Cohen",
        "timestamp": 1773933629
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm guessing the problem is that <code>substTy</code> uses well founded recursion?</p>",
        "id": 580460861,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1773933812
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>try this version instead: </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>(I'm guessing in your actual application <code>substTy</code> won't be the identity function)</p>",
        "id": 580462171,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1773934110
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Another alternative is</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">semireducible</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">termination_by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sizeOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ty</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>but that will reduce slower</p>",
        "id": 580462397,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1773934163
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"816344\">Aaron Liu</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/.60rfl.60.20does.20not.20work.20on.20definitionally.20equal.20terms/near/580462171\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>try this version instead: </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">xs</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>(I'm guessing in your actual application <code>substTy</code> won't be the identity function)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Thanks! This solution works, though it is a bit annoying to have to use explicit mutual recursion everywhere. Is there a reason that well-founded definitions don't reduce? <br>\n(And yes, <code>substTy</code> won't be the identity in the actual application <span aria-label=\"slight smile\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f642\" role=\"img\" title=\"slight smile\">:slight_smile:</span>)</p>",
        "id": 580463698,
        "sender_full_name": "Josh Cohen",
        "timestamp": 1773934443
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Or is <code>semireducible</code> the way to reduce well-founded definitions?</p>",
        "id": 580464328,
        "sender_full_name": "Josh Cohen",
        "timestamp": 1773934578
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"952838\">@Josh Cohen</span>  If you are willing to accept a proof that isn't <code>rfl</code>, but rather involves propositional equality, you can also use <code>cbv</code> here:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bool\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"int\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bool\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tcons</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"int\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MyTy</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">substTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TyDenote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toTy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cbv</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
